  AgeInUse=AGE_MODERN). NODE_CIVIC_MO_MAIN_* only exists while Modern is the active age. See
  emigration-policies-antiquity.xml for the full rationale.

  Four cards: the two stances (Social Question), Talent Attraction (Modernization) and Consular
  Protection (Political Theory). Cultural Magnetism, Commercial Draw, Refugee Compact, Equal Protection
  and Registration of Residents were retired in 3.6.0; their rows stay for saves that hold them, with no
  unlock.
-->
